<h1>U.S. Exchange Membership</h1>
<p>Membership is required to participate on the following U.S. equities and options exchanges:
<ul><li>Collectively - “Nasdaq,” “Nasdaq SROs” or “Exchanges”</li></ul> </p>
<div class="genTable static" style="borders: 0px">
<table>
<tr>
<td>
<p>
<h4>Equities:</h4><ul>
<li>The Nasdaq Stock Market LLC (“NQX”)</li>
<li>Nasdaq PSX (“PSX”) </li>
<li>Nasdaq Texas, LLC (“NTX”)</li></ul>
<h4>Options: </h4><ul>
<li>Nasdaq PHLX LLC (“PHLX”) </li>
<li>The Nasdaq Options Market LLC (“NOM”) </li>
<li>NTX Options</li>
<li>Nasdaq ISE (“ISE”)</li>
<li>Nasdaq GEMX ("GEMX")</li>
<li>Nasdaq MRX (“MRX”)</li></ul></p></td>
 <td align="Center" style="text-align: left;"><a href="/content/marketregulation/membership/NASDAQSROMembershipApplicationFinal.pdf"><img src="/images/applynow.png" border="0" style="position:relative;right:0px" /></a></td></tr></table></div>

<!--<br>
<div class="genTable static" style="borders: 0px">
<table>
<tr>
<td><h4>Options (GEMX/MRX): </h4><ul>
<li>Nasdaq ISE
<ul>
<li> <a href="/Content/MarketRegulation/MEMBERSHIP/NasdaqISEApplicationForm2017fillable.pdf">Membership Application</a></li></ul></li>
